Effect Documentation:

--------------------

if - Executes enclosed effects if limit criteria are met
if = { limit = { <triggers> } <effects> }
Supported Scopes: none

--------------------

else - Executes enclosed effects if the if before it failed
else = { limit = { <triggers> } <effects> }
Supported Scopes: none

--------------------

hidden_effect - Effect not shown in tooltips
Supported Scopes: none

--------------------

random_list - a random list effect
Supported Scopes: none

--------------------

trigger_event - triggers an event
trigger_event = { id = X days = Y }
Supported Scopes: none

--------------------

save_scope_as - saves the current scope
save_scope_as = name
Supported Scopes: none

--------------------

set_variable - sets a variable
set_variable = { name = X value = Y }
Supported Scopes: none

--------------------

add_to_variable_list - adds the target to a variable list
add_to_variable_list = { name = X target = Y }
Supported Scopes: none

--------------------

every_in_list - Iterate through all items in a list
every_in_list = { list = X variable = Y limit = { <triggers> } <effects> }
Supported Scopes: none

--------------------

add_prestige - adds prestige
Supported Scopes: country

--------------------

every_owned_location - Iterate through all owned locations
every_owned_location = { limit = { <triggers> } <effects> }
Supported Scopes: country
Supported Targets: location

--------------------
